  "description": "When a former detective wakes up as Ordelle Kyris, the villainess and fake saint of the novel \"Idella the Holy,\" she is entrusted with the task of saving the Sun God and this world from disappearing forever. However, being a fake, her divine power is close to nothing. And the only way to increase it is... money! From securing rich followers to starting a new business, Ordelle strives to gather funds and gain more power. Will this fake yet fiery saint successfully climb the ladder of holiness?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
